# The README recording. Run from the repository root with a linked Agent: vhs docs/media/demo.tape

Output docs/media/demo.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "slingshot info"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "slingshot run cargo build --release"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 20s

Type "slingshot health"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
